tree: traffic-and-dragons-next-ten-ending
===== 1. pairs: one half refused, the other lands
--- coin + item (the GM sells the hero a thing named by the word)
    You pay the mason. [GOLD:-25] [ITEM_GAINED:Constructor]
    summary: ["-25 gp","+Constructor"]
    after  : gold 50 | xp 0 | pack ["Longsword","Rope","Constructor"] | Kira ["Dagger","Rope"] | Bram alive | quest ["active"] | claims []
--- stow pair: the place operand is the word
    You set it down. [ITEM_LOST:Rope] [LOCATION_ITEM:Rope|placed|constructor]
    summary: ["-Rope","⚠ Stash refused — Rope (constructor): no such place on the map","⚠ 'Rope' stays in the pack — the placement was refused"]
    after  : gold 50 | xp 0 | pack ["Longsword","Rope"] | Kira ["Dagger","Rope"] | Bram alive | quest ["active"] | claims []
--- give pair: the receiver is the word
    You hand it over. [ITEM_LOST:Rope] [COMPANION_ITEM_GAINED:constructor|Rope]
    summary: ["-Rope","⚠ 'Rope' stays in the pack — no party member 'constructor' to give it to"]
    after  : gold 50 | xp 0 | pack ["Longsword","Rope"] | Kira ["Dagger","Rope"] | Bram alive | quest ["active"] | claims []
--- give pair, control receiver
    You hand it over. [ITEM_LOST:Rope] [COMPANION_ITEM_GAINED:construqtor|Rope]
    summary: ["-Rope","⚠ 'Rope' stays in the pack — no party member 'construqtor' to give it to"]
    after  : gold 50 | xp 0 | pack ["Longsword","Rope"] | Kira ["Dagger","Rope"] | Bram alive | quest ["active"] | claims []
===== 2. a canon marker with the word and NO partner marker (a cut-off reply, a forgotten END)
--- BEGIN with the word as subject, END missing
    He falls. [CANON_TXN_BEGIN:c1|npc-death|constructor|h1|-][NPC:Bram|dead|enemy][XP:50][GOLD:20]
    summary: []
    after  : gold 50 | xp 0 | pack ["Longsword","Rope"] | Kira ["Dagger","Rope"] | Bram alive | quest ["active"] | claims ["c1:quarantined"]
--- same, control subject
    He falls. [CANON_TXN_BEGIN:c1|npc-death|construqtor|h1|-][NPC:Bram|dead|enemy][XP:50][GOLD:20]
